name orientation
category Package
revision 57390
shortdesc Set page orientation with dvips/Ghostscript (ps2pdf)
longdesc This package provides commands for manual (per-page and
longdesc per-document) orientation of pages in a PDF created with
longdesc dvips/Ghostscript (ps2pdf). For future versions it is planned
longdesc to add support for other drivers, allowing for PDF orientation
longdesc to be set in (x)dvipdfmx and pdfmode pdfTeX using the same
longdesc commands from the user perspective.
